cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EmbodiSteer, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "EmbodiSteer: Steering Embodiment-Agnostic Visuomotor Policies with Joint-Space Guidance for Zero-Shot Cross-Embodiment Deployment"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Inference-time steering for deploying a frozen Cartesian diffusion policy
  across robot embodiments with kinematic and whole-body collision guidance.
authors:
